    "detailed_description": "Fluffy Jumping Adventure - Catting Over It: You must fight for your love, never giving up! A dangerous monster has kidnapped the love of your life! This challenging journey to the top will require great skill in calculating trajectories, self-control, and the ability to plan your actions. Just remember, falling is not scary, at the bottom awaits a soft blanket and your beloved basket.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693920/extras/0d42f4057c4dcd280e0a6720676903dc.poster.avif?t=1715673103\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693920/extras/0d42f4057c4dcd280e0a6720676903dc.webm?t=1715673103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><u>Main features:</u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Prepare for complex trajectory calculations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693920/extras/1fe3f06595dbcdd95bac76b285ffb00a.poster.avif?t=1715673103\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693920/extras/1fe3f06595dbcdd95bac76b285ffb00a.webm?t=1715673103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693920/extras/1fe3f06595dbcdd95bac76b285ffb00a.mp4?t=1715673103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li> While going up, you can find skill points, build your character, but remember, different skill sets may be needed for each level.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693920/extras/9c7b8cffb4b1a7b1cf31341eb33f1abf.poster.avif?t=1715673103\" width=480 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693920/extras/9c7b8cffb4b1a7b1cf31341eb33f1abf.webm?t=1715673103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693920/extras/9c7b8cffb4b1a7b1cf31341eb33f1abf.mp4?t=1715673103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li> The main zone in the game is safe, you can only fall down in it, but there is an enemy territory where death is possible, but you will respawn in your home basket and skill points will not be lost.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693920/extras/0976190c923ba08caf8f30cdb7634d01.poster.avif?t=1715673103\" width=480 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693920/extras/0976190c923ba08caf8f30cdb7634d01.webm?t=1715673103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693920/extras/0976190c923ba08caf8f30cdb7634d01.mp4?t=1715673103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li> Don't be afraid to fall, home is always good, you can learn the acquired skills there and become even stronger.<br></li><li> The higher you climb, the stronger you will level up your character.<br></li><li> There will be puzzles along the way that you can solve to make your path to the top easier.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693920/extras/e839a01facbd73f096b31eef8de83dc5.poster.avif?t=1715673103\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693920/extras/e839a01facbd73f096b31eef8de83dc5.webm?t=1715673103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693920/extras/e839a01facbd73f096b31eef8de83dc5.mp4?t=1715673103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li> Explore unique game levels and overcome obstacles along the way.</li></ul>",
